{"scene_id": "s00960", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00960.fountain", "heading": "EXT. ICE-LOCKED LIFEBOAT, ARCTIC FLOE - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CAPTAIN BRYNHILD OLSEN-ADESANYA", "names": ["CAPTAIN BRYNHILD OLSEN-ADESANYA", "BRYNHILD"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 1, "name": "FIRST MATE HIRAM DELACROIX-NWOSU", "names": ["FIRST MATE HIRAM DELACROIX-NWOSU", "HIRAM"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 2, "name": "FINA", "names": ["FINA"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 3, "name": "LARSEN-OKAFOR", "names": ["LARSEN-OKAFOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 4, "name": "TEMPERANCE BRIGGS-MOHAMMED", "names": ["TEMPERANCE BRIGGS-MOHAMMED", "TEMPERANCE"], "gender": "?", "first": 8, "spoke": 2}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. ICE-LOCKED LIFEBOAT, ARCTIC FLOE - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A battered orange lifeboat frozen into a plain of pack ice.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "White sky.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "White ground.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The only color: the boat, four parkas, and a thin line of red blood on the ice.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "CAPTAIN BRYNHILD OLSEN-ADESANYA (50s, frost in her eyebrows, a compass on a lanyard) crouches at the stern, rationing biscuits.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from her, FIRST MATE HIRAM DELACROIX-NWOSU (40s, one glove missing) sits staring at his bare hand.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "At the bow, COOK YOSEFINA \"FINA\" LARSEN-OKAFOR (30s) feeds a tin stove with the last of the splinters.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "And curled in the bottom of the boat, wrapped in a tarp, lies deckhand TEMPERANCE BRIGGS-MOHAMMED (20s), breathing shallowly.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nine biscuits. Four of us.", "name": "BRYNHILD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Two and a quarter each.", "name": "FINA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Two each. The quarter goes to Temperance.", "name": "BRYNHILD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She won't eat it.", "name": "HIRAM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She will.", "name": "BRYNHILD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Temperance stirs.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Her eyelids flutter.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it morning?", "name": "TEMPERANCE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": ["hoarse"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's morning.", "name": "FINA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it warm?", "name": "TEMPERANCE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No, love.", "name": "FINA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["gently"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "A silence.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "The stove ticks.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "The wind picks up, sliding a ribbon of snow across the floe.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Hiram's head lifts.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "He cocks it, listening.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do you hear that?", "name": "HIRAM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hear what?", "name": "BRYNHILD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "An engine.", "name": "HIRAM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "They all go still.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Far off, a faint drone.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Fina laughs, one cracked note.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the wind.", "name": "FINA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's an engine, Fina.", "name": "HIRAM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Brynhild stands, shading her eyes.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "A dark speck on the horizon, growing.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Temperance grips the tarp.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Then the speck resolves into a long gray shape with a red cross on its flank, and the drone swells into the unmistakable thrum of a rescue helicopter.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody cheers.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody moves.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Then Hiram begins to weep, and Fina puts her arm around him, and Brynhild picks up the flare gun with a hand that will not stop shaking.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}